      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.size
      value: 20
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcSprites.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[0]
      value: n-Ryoma
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[1]
      value: e-0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[2]
      value: "\xA1Hola! T\xFA debes de ser Fede, el sobrino de Joaqu\xEDn."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Llegas en buen momento, \xBFQu\xE9 tal si me ayudas a meter las vacas
        en el granero?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[4]
      value: n-Fede
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[5]
      value: e-0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[6]
      value: "No se preocupe, estoy informado de la situaci\xF3n, \xBFc\xF3mo podr\xEDa
        devolver las vacas a su sitio?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[7]
      value: n-Ryoma
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[8]
      value: e-0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[9]
      value: " Estas vacas pueden ser un poco traicioneras\u2026 Te voy a contar
        un secreto muchacho: "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcSprites.Array.data[0]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4935e2727e337954ab6056d5c2cfdfc3, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcSprites.Array.data[1]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8d01efbcedb05da4090c143fbb2d41c2, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcSprites.Array.data[2]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 95aeed0e09fe1c243a3c4bf975e5371e, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.size
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[10]
      value: Las vacas siempre se ponen nerviosas cuando les das una cachetada.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[11]
      value: "Para llevarlas al interior del granero, pulsa (E) y las har\xE1s salir
        corriendo hacia la puerta."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[12]
      value: e-2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[13]
      value: "Otra cosa... \xDAltimamente unos topos han estado causando problemas
        por la zona..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[14]
      value: "En cuanto las vacas pisoteen un poco la tierra, se empezar\xE1n a mosquear
        y saldr\xE1n de su escondite, ahuyentando a las vacas cercanas."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[15]
      value: e-1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[16]
      value: "Ten cuidado e intenta reunirlas lo antes posible, que dentro de un
        rato tengo que presentarlas en una exhibici\xF3n."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[17]
      value: n-Fede
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[18]
      value: e-0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[19]
      value: "Gracias, har\xE9 lo que pueda."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[20]
      value: "Gracias, har\xE9 lo que pueda"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[21]
      value: "Gracias, har\xE9 lo que pueda"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[0]
      value: n-Ryoma
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[1]
      value: e-0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[2]
      value: "\xA1Muchas gracias chaval! Te lo agradezco mucho de verdad. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Esos dichosos topos llevan viviendo en la granja desde hace mucho tiempo
        y no hay manera de sacarlos de aqu\xED."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[4]
      value: e-1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[5]
      value: "\xBFY esto? (un topo con un aspecto diferente a los dem\xE1s se acerca
        a t\xED)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[6]
      value: "(Por alg\xFAn motivo, sent\xEDs una conexi\xF3n especial)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Este peque\xF1o parece que quiere quedarse contigo. Si se va contigo
        te lo voy a agradecer (un problema que me quito)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[8]
      value: e-0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[9]
      value: "EN FIN, si no necesitas nada m\xE1s, aqu\xED tienes la leche para tu
        t\xEDo."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[10]
      value: e-1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[11]
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[12]
      value: "Por cierto, creo que tu t\xEDo me pidi\xF3 hace tiempo que le llevara
        una roca m\xE1gica que activa alguno de los portales que tiene en su planeta."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[13]
      value: e-0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[14]
      value: "S\xE9 que ronda por este planeta as\xED que te aconsejo que te des
        una vuelta a ver que te encuentras. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5036363909712305072, guid: 95cd5e6784a15b041ae632f75e13a428, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatedLines.Array.data[15]
      value: "\xA1Adi\xF3s chaval!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
